	(text "HOW TO USE:\nTo write: toggle the (WE)' switch (pulls it L) while CS stays L,\nwrite data, I/O acts as input, chip takes in whatever data switches are set to.\nTo read: toggle the (OE)' switch (pulls it L) while (WE)' is untoggled (H) and CS stays L,\nread data, I/O acts as output, chip drives Y0/Y1 lines."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
